Rem EDITOR
' Detokenizer: constants, keywords, extensions
A=$FF : B=$7FFFFFFF : C=%1011 : D=%0 : E=$0
F#=1.5 : G#=-0.25 : H=1E+10 : I$="Text" : K$='Single'
If A>B and C<>D Then Print "yes" Else Print "no"
For J=1 To 10 Step 2 : Next J
Do : Exit : Loop : Repeat : Until A=255
LABEL: Gosub LABEL2 : Goto LABEL
LABEL2: Return
Procedure TEST[X,Y$]
   Shared A : Print X;Y$
End Proc[X*2]
TEST[$10,Hex$($ABC,4)+Bin$(%11,8)]
Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres : Bob 1,10,20,1 : Sam Play 1
Track Play 1 : Pack 0 To 10 : Reserve As Work 10,1024
A=1+
